###### AUTH ######
### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auths/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "admin@rascal.id",
    "password": "admin123"
}

### Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/auths/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Cookie: {{refreshToken}}

### Refresh
POST {{baseUrl}}/auths/refresh
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Cookie: {{refreshToken}}


###### AUTHORITIES ######
### Get by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/auths/authorities/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search active or GetAll
GET {{baseUrl}}/auths/authorities
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/auths/authorities/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


###### ROLES ######
### Create
POST {{baseUrl}}/auths/roles
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "name": "ADMIN",
    "authorityIds": [1]
}

### Update role (PUT)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/auths/roles/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "ADMIN",
    "authorityIds": [1]
}

### Patch role (partial)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/auths/roles/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "ADMIN"
}

### Get By ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/auths/roles/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search active or GetAll
GET {{baseUrl}}/auths/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


###### USERS ######
### Create
POST {{baseUrl}}/auths/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "email": "faiqemilzzz@gmail.com",
    "password": "asdqwe123",
    "roleIds": [1]
}

### Get by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/auths/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search active or GetAll
GET {{baseUrl}}/auths/users?email=admin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update user (PUT) — email, password, dan roleIds wajib
PUT {{baseUrl}}/auths/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "faiqemilzzz@gmail.com",
    "password": "newPassword123",
    "roleIds": [1]
}

### Update user (PATCH)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/auths/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "roleIds": [1]
}

### Delete
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/auths/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


###### PASSWORD RESET ######
### Forgot Password
POST {{baseUrl}}/auths/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "admin@rascal.id"
}

### Reset Password (token format: {userId}_{rawToken} from email link, successful reset revokes all sessions)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auths/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "token": "{USER_ID}_{YOUR_RESET_TOKEN}",
    "newPassword": "newpassword123"
}
